WEBVTT

00:00:00.142 --> 00:00:06.371
Open the video part's settings. The tabs let you adjust this part of the reel.

00:00:06.371 --> 00:00:17.959
Use “Zoom” to adjust the framing, then check the result in “Preview”.

00:00:17.959 --> 00:00:26.802
Play the part to check the closer framing while the video is moving.
